1
00:00:01,805 --> 00:00:04,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">Straight A's,
Daddy-o.</font>

2
00:00:04,347 --> 00:00:06,389
<font color="#FFFFFF">Nope. I don't see
any athletics on here.</font>

3
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:08,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, I'm not much
of a sports guy.</font>

4
00:00:08,139 --> 00:00:09,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm more of a good-grades guy.</font>

5
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:10,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's who I am.</font>

6
00:00:12,013 --> 00:00:13,264
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey!</font>

7
00:00:13,305 --> 00:00:15,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">Son, good grades won't get you
anywhere in life.</font>

8
00:00:15,721 --> 00:00:18,347
<font color="#FFFFFF">You only get places through
athletic accomplishments.</font>

9
00:00:18,389 --> 00:00:19,721
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, what about
Bill Gates?</font>

10
00:00:19,763 --> 00:00:22,264
<font color="#FFFFFF">Before he blew out his ACL
and had to do computers,</font>

11
00:00:22,305 --> 00:00:24,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bill Gates rushed
for over 300 yards a game.</font>

12
00:00:24,847 --> 00:00:26,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh, I don't think
that's right, Dad.</font>

13
00:00:26,596 --> 00:00:28,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I don't know
the recipe for apple pie,</font>

14
00:00:28,471 --> 00:00:30,721
<font color="#FFFFFF">but that didn't stop me
from making one.</font>

15
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:34,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now, while that cools,</font>

16
00:00:34,139 --> 00:00:35,347
<font color="#FFFFFF">come on, I want
to show you something.</font>

17
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:39,638
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Stan Smith
Wrestling Museum,</font>

18
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:43,222
<font color="#FFFFFF">dedicated to the high school
wrestling career of Stan Smith.</font>

19
00:00:43,264 --> 00:00:46,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">Um, I've lived in this
house my whole life.</font>

20
00:00:46,222 --> 00:00:47,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">How long's this
been here?</font>

21
00:00:47,513 --> 00:00:50,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">Construction of the museum
began in 1998.</font>

22
00:00:50,513 --> 00:00:52,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">I should know because,
like Ross on <i>Friends,</i></font>

23
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:54,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm a docent.</font>

24
00:00:54,139 --> 00:00:56,721
<font color="#FFFFFF">But unlike Ross,
I don't look like a Monchichi.</font>

25
00:00:56,763 --> 00:00:58,847
<font color="#FFFFFF">I take the tour
every day.</font>

26
00:00:58,888 --> 00:01:01,763
<font color="#FFFFFF">Except for Sundays,
when the tour is free</font>

27
00:01:01,805 --> 00:01:04,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">and the place gets
a little…</font>

28
00:01:04,097 --> 00:01:05,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">ethnic.</font>

29
00:01:05,638 --> 00:01:08,389
<font color="#FFFFFF">Steve, I was once
a loser just like you.</font>

30
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:09,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hurtful.</font>

31
00:01:09,555 --> 00:01:11,972
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then, in my junior year,
I took up wrestling.</font>

32
00:01:12,013 --> 00:01:13,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">It changed my life.</font>

33
00:01:13,596 --> 00:01:16,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">I went from zero to hero
to De Niro.</font>

34
00:01:16,513 --> 00:01:20,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">"You talkin' to me?
You talkin' to me?"</font>

35
00:01:20,972 --> 00:01:22,763
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh…</font>

36
00:01:22,805 --> 00:01:25,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">And the ultimate testament
to my greatness</font>

37
00:01:25,222 --> 00:01:27,721
<font color="#FFFFFF">is the state record
I still hold.</font>

38
00:01:27,763 --> 00:01:30,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">20 wins in a row.</font>

39
00:01:31,596 --> 00:01:34,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">And no one's even come close
to beating it.</font>

40
00:01:34,347 --> 00:01:36,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yep, that record there
is the mark</font>

41
00:01:36,347 --> 00:01:37,721
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've made on this Earth.</font>

42
00:01:37,763 --> 00:01:40,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">And when I'm gone,
it will remain.</font>

43
00:01:40,972 --> 00:01:42,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">Without it, I am nothing.</font>

44
00:01:42,596 --> 00:01:45,389
<font color="#FFFFFF">I certainly wouldn't have
a great piece of ass like this.</font>

45
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:49,264
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know who else
really appreciates my rump?</font>

46
00:01:49,305 --> 00:01:50,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">Charlotte.</font>

47
00:01:52,638 --> 00:01:54,763
<font color="#FFFFFF">The point is, if you want
to get anywhere in life,</font>

48
00:01:54,805 --> 00:01:56,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">you have to join
the wrestling team.</font>

49
00:01:56,222 --> 00:01:57,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gee, Dad, that
sounds great.</font>

50
00:01:57,972 --> 00:01:59,389
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, no.</font>

51
00:01:59,430 --> 00:02:02,389
<font color="#FFFFFF">The school doesn't have
a wrestling program anymore.</font>

52
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:04,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ah, squigglebottom.</font>

53
00:02:04,097 --> 00:02:06,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">What? I am outraged!</font>

54
00:02:06,347 --> 00:02:07,972
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, take your
outrage elsewhere.</font>

55
00:02:08,013 --> 00:02:09,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have another group
coming through.</font>

56
00:02:09,471 --> 00:02:11,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll exit through
the gift shop.</font>

57
00:02:11,721 --> 00:02:13,013
<font color="#FFFFFF">Make sure to check out</font>

58
00:02:13,055 --> 00:02:15,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">our Stan Smith pan flute
rain forest music.</font>

59
00:02:17,513 --> 00:02:19,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">Each song
sounds the same,</font>

60
00:02:19,139 --> 00:02:21,972
<font color="#FFFFFF">yet somehow manages
to be worse than the last.</font>

61
00:02:24,430 --> 00:02:26,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">As many of you know,
the wrestling program</font>

62
00:02:26,596 --> 00:02:28,222
<font color="#FFFFFF">has been defunct
for several years.</font>

63
00:02:28,264 --> 00:02:29,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ever since the former coach</font>

64
00:02:29,847 --> 00:02:31,721
<font color="#FFFFFF">was caught teaching
a style of wrestling</font>

65
00:02:31,763 --> 00:02:33,972
<font color="#FFFFFF">that would perhaps be
more at home in a prison…</font>

66
00:02:34,013 --> 00:02:38,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">between a prisoner
and a weaker, prettier prisoner.</font>

67
00:02:38,139 --> 00:02:40,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">But now an annoying…
I mean, involved… parent</font>

68
00:02:40,972 --> 00:02:42,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">wants to bring the program back.</font>

69
00:02:42,513 --> 00:02:44,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">I give you
the most decorated wrestler</font>

70
00:02:44,847 --> 00:02:47,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">in Pearl Bailey history,
Stan Smith.</font>

71
00:02:49,347 --> 00:02:50,763
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thank you.</font>

72
00:02:50,805 --> 00:02:52,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">Anyone interested
in joining the wrestling team,</font>

73
00:02:52,972 --> 00:02:54,389
<font color="#FFFFFF">please raise your hand.</font>

74
00:02:58,180 --> 00:03:00,347
<font color="#FFFFFF">What if I said you get to do
stuff like this?</font>

75
00:03:01,638 --> 00:03:02,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">Aah! My back!</font>

76
00:03:04,055 --> 00:03:05,638
<font color="#FFFFFF">How about that?</font>

77
00:03:09,596 --> 00:03:10,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">Congratulations, Steve.</font>

78
00:03:10,972 --> 00:03:12,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">You and your friends
made the cut.</font>

79
00:03:13,513 --> 00:03:16,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">So I give you
your Pearl Bailey</font>

80
00:03:16,180 --> 00:03:18,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">varsity high school
wrestling team.</font>

81
00:03:19,930 --> 00:03:22,013
<font color="#FFFFFF">Um, just going
back a sec.</font>

82
00:03:22,055 --> 00:03:23,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you saying
Coach Keegan,</font>

83
00:03:23,596 --> 00:03:25,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">who is now
the baseball coach,</font>

84
00:03:25,180 --> 00:03:27,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">his wrestlers?</font>

85
00:03:27,638 --> 00:03:30,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">That was a long time ago.</font>

86
00:03:36,763 --> 00:03:38,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, gladiators.</font>

87
00:03:38,471 --> 00:03:40,347
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is what we've practiced
so hard for.</font>

88
00:03:40,389 --> 00:03:41,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">Our first meet.</font>

89
00:03:41,596 --> 00:03:42,721
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're going to kill them!</font>

90
00:03:42,763 --> 00:03:44,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">Schmuely,
remember what I taught you?</font>

91
00:03:44,347 --> 00:03:45,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, Coach.
Good.</font>

92
00:03:45,847 --> 00:03:48,263
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now, get in there
and destroy this guy.</font>

93
00:03:48,264 --> 00:03:50,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, my god!</font>

94
00:03:50,180 --> 00:03:52,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not going well
for Snot.</font>

95
00:03:52,222 --> 00:03:54,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, my god!</font>

96
00:03:54,471 --> 00:03:55,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">But don't worry, Son.</font>

97
00:03:55,513 --> 00:03:57,264
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're a Smith.
You'll be fine.</font>

98
00:03:57,305 --> 00:03:58,847
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's lying!</font>

99
00:03:58,888 --> 00:04:00,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">You won't be fine!</font>

100
00:04:00,721 --> 00:04:02,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">Call my aunt!</font>

101
00:04:19,013 --> 00:04:22,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">That tickles.
Tickles.</font>

102
00:04:22,097 --> 00:04:24,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tickling. Ticklish.</font>

103
00:04:35,596 --> 00:04:37,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">Timber!</font>

104
00:04:40,471 --> 00:04:41,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">Nice, Barry.</font>

105
00:04:41,555 --> 00:04:42,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, Barry!</font>

106
00:04:44,930 --> 00:04:48,972
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm having trouble changing
into my street clothes.</font>

107
00:04:49,013 --> 00:04:51,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, Steve,
the biggest myth in wrestling</font>

108
00:04:51,555 --> 00:04:53,013
<font color="#FFFFFF">is that you need
strong arms.</font>

109
00:04:53,055 --> 00:04:54,347
<font color="#FFFFFF">Like kangaroos and rapists,</font>

110
00:04:54,389 --> 00:04:56,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">all your power
comes from your legs.</font>

111
00:04:56,555 --> 00:04:58,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">I might have said frogs,
but yeah.</font>

112
00:04:58,139 --> 00:04:59,389
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's why I'm
going to have you</font>

113
00:04:59,430 --> 00:05:01,264
<font color="#FFFFFF">run the Chimdale Stairs,</font>

114
00:05:01,305 --> 00:05:04,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">the longest staircase
in North America.</font>

115
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:13,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was a child when I fell.</font>

116
00:05:15,930 --> 00:05:18,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">With stronger legs
from the stairs, you can't lose.</font>

117
00:05:18,847 --> 00:05:21,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not to mention I dropped you
into a lower weight class.</font>

118
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:26,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">I am not
showing improvement.</font>

119
00:05:30,972 --> 00:05:32,013
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh-oh.</font>

120
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:52,972
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who wants him to die?</font>

121
00:06:01,055 --> 00:06:02,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your boy's doing
great, Stan.</font>

122
00:06:02,972 --> 00:06:04,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">He hasn't won
a single match all season.</font>

123
00:06:04,930 --> 00:06:09,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, I'm talking about Badass
Barry the Butterball Bear.</font>

124
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:13,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">Named him myself.</font>

125
00:06:13,638 --> 00:06:15,847
<font color="#FFFFFF">Took me 19 days.</font>

126
00:06:15,888 --> 00:06:17,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's undefeated.</font>

127
00:06:17,638 --> 00:06:20,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">Only three wins away from
beating your record.</font>

128
00:06:20,222 --> 00:06:21,222
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

129
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:26,347
<font color="#FFFFFF">Make that two
wins away.</font>

130
00:06:26,389 --> 00:06:29,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">My god, I've been
so focused on Steve,</font>

131
00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:30,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">I… I didn't
even realize.</font>

132
00:06:31,972 --> 00:06:33,264
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know, maybe…
maybe Barry</font>

133
00:06:33,305 --> 00:06:34,847
<font color="#FFFFFF">should sit out a match,
get some rest.</font>

134
00:06:34,888 --> 00:06:35,873
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, no, no, no, no.</font>

135
00:06:35,888 --> 00:06:37,222
<font color="#FFFFFF">I got money on
that belly.</font>

136
00:06:37,264 --> 00:06:39,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">25 G's he breaks
your record.</font>

137
00:06:39,471 --> 00:06:41,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">I got a bookie who'll
take action on anything.</font>

138
00:06:41,847 --> 00:06:44,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, my god!
I just got my first period.</font>

139
00:06:44,930 --> 00:06:45,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ha!</font>

140
00:06:45,972 --> 00:06:48,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">Earl, you owe me
25 bucks.</font>

141
00:06:48,222 --> 00:06:49,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">How'd you know?</font>

142
00:06:49,347 --> 00:06:51,721
<font color="#FFFFFF">Always bet on red.</font>

143
00:06:51,763 --> 00:06:53,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">Anyway, the
boy wrestles.</font>

144
00:06:53,596 --> 00:06:54,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">I-I… I really
don't think…</font>

145
00:06:54,930 --> 00:06:57,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">I said the
boy wrestles!</font>

146
00:07:00,471 --> 00:07:01,638
<font color="#FFFFFF">I spent a lot of time</font>

147
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">Photoshopping Reagan
into that picture.</font>

148
00:07:03,347 --> 00:07:05,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">And for what?
For nothing.</font>

149
00:07:05,638 --> 00:07:07,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan, you're making
too much of this.</font>

150
00:07:07,972 --> 00:07:09,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you think
Corey Haim cares</font>

151
00:07:09,721 --> 00:07:12,222
<font color="#FFFFFF">that Corey Feldman went
on to great success?</font>

152
00:07:12,264 --> 00:07:14,847
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, Corey Haim's
doing great.</font>

153
00:07:14,888 --> 00:07:17,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">But it's the foundation
of who I am.</font>

154
00:07:17,471 --> 00:07:20,264
<font color="#FFFFFF">Without that record,
I… I'll have nothing.</font>

155
00:07:20,305 --> 00:07:21,972
<font color="#FFFFFF">Charlotte!</font>

156
00:07:26,305 --> 00:07:28,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shut up, Charlotte!</font>

157
00:07:34,222 --> 00:07:36,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">What am I going to do about
Barry beating my record?</font>

158
00:07:36,638 --> 00:07:39,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's only one thing
you can do: sabotage.</font>

159
00:07:39,972 --> 00:07:41,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">You gotta take Barry out.</font>

160
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,540
<font color="#FFFFFF">Excuse me. Hi.</font>

161
00:07:43,555 --> 00:07:45,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">Were you videotaping that?</font>

162
00:07:45,139 --> 00:07:47,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">'Cause I'm sort of planning
a crime against a child here.</font>

163
00:07:52,513 --> 00:07:54,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't do that. I'm his coach.</font>

164
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:56,347
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, but I can.</font>

165
00:07:56,389 --> 00:07:58,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">You… you'd do it for me?</font>

166
00:07:58,847 --> 00:08:00,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'd do it for me.</font>

167
00:08:00,097 --> 00:08:01,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm a docent, Stan.</font>

168
00:08:01,347 --> 00:08:03,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">If he breaks your record,
I'm out of a job.</font>

169
00:08:03,471 --> 00:08:05,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I will not go back
to Relax the Back.</font>

170
00:08:05,930 --> 00:08:08,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">I repeat, I won't go
back to Relax the Back,</font>

171
00:08:08,721 --> 00:08:11,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">as long as Douglas works there,
and we both know Douglas</font>

172
00:08:11,471 --> 00:08:13,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">is going to work there
for the rest of his life.</font>

173
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:15,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, Roger.</font>

174
00:08:15,347 --> 00:08:17,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's do it.</font>

175
00:08:19,596 --> 00:08:21,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">Roger should have
been back by now.</font>

176
00:08:21,596 --> 00:08:23,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">How long does it take
to maim a kid?</font>

177
00:08:23,930 --> 00:08:25,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mission accomplished.</font>

178
00:08:25,139 --> 00:08:27,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">I did him
Tonya Harding style.</font>

179
00:08:27,180 --> 00:08:28,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">With a…
and a…</font>

180
00:08:28,596 --> 00:08:29,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">and a…</font>

181
00:08:31,596 --> 00:08:33,347
<font color="#FFFFFF">Somebody
beat up Snot!</font>

182
00:08:33,389 --> 00:08:35,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh, aren't you Snot?</font>

183
00:08:35,471 --> 00:08:37,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm Barry.</font>

184
00:08:37,097 --> 00:08:39,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan, I might have
got the wrong one.</font>

185
00:08:41,430 --> 00:08:44,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why? Why?</font>

186
00:08:44,721 --> 00:08:46,847
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why ask why?</font>

187
00:08:46,888 --> 00:08:48,389
<font color="#FFFFFF">Try Bud Dry.</font>

188
00:08:48,430 --> 00:08:50,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's an old reference.</font>

189
00:08:50,180 --> 00:08:53,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not as old as the Nancy Kerrigan
thing you're doing.</font>

190
00:08:58,638 --> 00:08:59,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, watch it with that thing.</font>

191
00:08:59,930 --> 00:09:02,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're the one
who put me in this chair.</font>

192
00:09:02,097 --> 00:09:04,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">I crippled your legs,
not your manners.</font>

193
00:09:06,389 --> 00:09:07,888
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where's my lucky
butterball?</font>

194
00:09:07,930 --> 00:09:08,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's up next.</font>

195
00:09:09,805 --> 00:09:10,748
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know.</font>

196
00:09:10,763 --> 00:09:12,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">He should be here.</font>

197
00:09:12,513 --> 00:09:15,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gee, I hope
he makes it on time.</font>

198
00:09:19,972 --> 00:09:22,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad, I got a good feeling
about this one.</font>

199
00:09:23,972 --> 00:09:26,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">Aah! He's so nimble!</font>

200
00:09:36,638 --> 00:09:38,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">That was my longest
